[{"title":"住静 其八","author":"释大香","text":"荒居无法侣，古德有家风。\n一个泥涂灶，三间茅草蓬。\n自来青嶂里，不出白云中。\n岁尽还开岁，空门只自空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜","author":"释大香","text":"暗壁通花气，虚楹覆竹阴。\n乱云双树寂，一雪万山深。\n永夜枯僧定，寒空古佛心。\n断猿风外啸，隐隐落层岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青甲舟中","author":"释大香","text":"碧水漾群影，游鳞细可分。\n飞来数点雁，题破一方云。\n远火微犹见，残钟断复闻。\n舟程应未极，随月宿溪濆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泛","author":"释大香","text":"几片萧疏叶，霜容点碧岚。\n波平如在地，舟小亦同龛。\n白水成佳供，清香佐野谈。\n莫辞归路杳，皓月挂溪南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行","author":"释大香","text":"暝色缘江路，炊烟缕缕生。\n飘花知水定，坐鸟看人行。\n翠岭连双驿，丹枫隔一城。\n昔年清宴处，犹有踏歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会徐波","author":"释大香","text":"一自归空寂，前因记未真。\n十年馀此晤，四海更何人。\n絮袅烟中月，萍移水上春。\n风吹灯夕梦，散入北邙尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别方功甫之天目","author":"释大香","text":"经年依古寺，知尔正囊空。\n为别秋冬际，论心山水中。\n新霜欺病叶，残雨湿离鸿。\n浮玉峰头月，清光似不同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东阿庵","author":"释大香","text":"麇迹缘厓见，泉流绕砌闻。\n涧花寒背日，山鼠夜啼云。\n千岭从西折，诸峰竞北分。\n木冰呈晓玩，四绕白纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下城高庵","author":"释大香","text":"花发秋无数，空香雪满庭。\n溪回双股碧，峰断两眉青。\n禅影林俱寂，经声鸟自听。\n岩云吹欲堕，千仞立孤亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿月窟","author":"释大香","text":"昃月下前丘，清光不尽收。\n洞云三叠晓，野水一湾秋。\n烟翠流长笛，空香堕小楼。\n回瞻飞鸟处，信宿在峰头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其一","author":"释大香","text":"初寒渐觉透疏棂，败箨残枝满户庭。\n水院还他僧宝传，山农问我佛名经。\n烟萋蔓草迷秋蝶，月暗荒榛聚夜萤。\n一种幽葩深涧底，了无人采自青青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其二","author":"释大香","text":"信得居山懒出山，此生终老此山间。\n松眠绝壑心俱死，鹤立空潭影亦闲。\n缸灶过时常不暖，荆扉向晚未曾关。\n一从鹫岭拈花后，更有何人为破颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"释大香","text":"袅袅东风蝶试衣，绵绵芳草燕争飞。\n堤边杨柳青丝骑，水上桃花白板扉。\n三竺片云双树隔，六陵残雨一僧归。\n年年最好春阳月，无那钟声送夕晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山夜坐","author":"释大香","text":"苍苔岩畔坐忘言，蒹菼离离带夕昏。\n千里梦回莼菜美，三旬病起稻花繁。\n碧云到海秋无隙，白鸟翻空夜有痕。\n明日又携瓢笠去，百城烟水扣谁门？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山晓起","author":"释大香","text":"隔林清磬渐无闻，已有睛晖映瀫纹。\n扫径不妨留鹤迹，开门只许到鸥群。\n寒峰独透千层雪，野水双勾一抹云。\n手启香函看宿火，碧烟袅袅古花文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙吟洞","author":"释大香","text":"重岚曲隐树中央，乍有闲僧构草堂。\n带雨龙归磁钵润，衔花鹿过衲衣香。\n残秋待月投空洞，后夜和云宿上方。\n一种红蕉舒艳色，名楼高处傲青霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜啸月冈","author":"释大香","text":"破絮蒲团展夕阴，一天凉思坐来禁。\n蛩声诉出秋多少，竹影描成夜浅深。\n青壁谩留闲里句，碧潭微见空中心。\n林猿野鹤成相识，又欲褰裳过别岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其一","author":"释大香","text":"梅花昨夜破寒汀，晓日初融露尚零。\n无事道人翻有事，一枝先供佛前瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其三","author":"释大香","text":"万竹千松远近同，嫩岚残霭有无中。\n斜阳不会藏踪迹，露出前峰一抹红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤城","author":"释大香","text":"南北峰青雨乍分，瀑花飘下雪纷纷。\n空岩夜久无群动，一点闲灯伴白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铁板嶂","author":"释大香","text":"一屏浑铁自天成，倒影清波月正明。\n三十六峰秋色里，幔亭高处独吹笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"托钵","author":"释大香","text":"十里春风五里桥，到山犹觉路岧峣。\n丛丛花草萧萧竹，几处柴门闭寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访隐","author":"释大香","text":"孤云底事未还山，缚草为门亦自关。\n一树垂杨铺水面，东风袅袅不曾闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊浔阳江","author":"释大香","text":"倚棹秋光对碧峰，露香倾下木芙蓉。\n西林月白东林晓，两处敲残百八钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮","author":"释大香","text":"一半筠帘上小钩，残书数卷未经收。\n东风忒也司闲事，吹得瓶花满案头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迟舜五不至","author":"释大香","text":"数点残星秋耿耿，斜风剪碎芭蕉影。\n自爱凭阑不爱眠，辘轳牵动鸳鸯井。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送春","author":"释大香","text":"春光今夕别侬家，啼断流莺落尽花。\n便欲出门相送去，不知何路向天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登铜官山无畏庵作","author":"智舷","text":"铜官鞠为草，孰识此岭下。\n松似天目移，山如巨然画。\n猛虎户外睡，古月泉上挂。\n遐想无畏师，此中住持罢。\n外人曾不闻，前僧后僧话。\n应是古道场，同门不同舍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简道可法兄","author":"智舷","text":"顷读蕉上咏，畴不尔倾倒。\n言外托微旨，拙中寓大巧。\n咏歌已臻此，赏识应不少。\n如何壮齿时，不得展所抱。\n遁迹此湖山，忘机如鸥鸟。\n白云与往还，童子日围绕。\n长者未弱冠，次者发覆脑。\n更有六七人，聪慧益稚小。\n有时瞰师出，非蛮即斗草。\n礼法未易闲，天机不欲矫。\n若问祖师意，当下无不了。\n相知寡老成，孰若此幼好。\n百年俯仰间，取足便烦恼。\n目前苟可娱，此外一齐扫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日南庵诸子见过 其一","author":"智舷","text":"偶然憩南野，高荫欣古木。\n室中晤言稀，树下坐忘独。\n枉棹来故人，逗啸看新竹。\n深林长闭门，丰草高于屋。\n何物款素心，愿言宵炳烛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日南庵诸子见过 其二","author":"智舷","text":"野处虽已适，久不闻高咏。\n炳烛夜何短，含毫晓未竟。\n凉雨原上来，洗我竹林净。\n荷池涨莫知，松檐溜可听。\n小舠勿遽还，出啸风波劲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题郁氏古村图","author":"智舷","text":"仲夏喜无事，披图探野趣。\n不离方寸间，写出几村树。\n鸟道入高冥，人家在烟雾。\n溪口挽钓船，草际横樵路。\n是谁幽栖士，遗韵宛如故？\n掩映屋东西，松竹凌霜露。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叶熙时还新安省亲尊公读书于黄山之指月庵","author":"智舷","text":"今年季秋与孟冬，馀也踏遍黄山峰。\n归来相对数竿竹，倦锡倚壁雪满屋。\n送君手捉天台藤，打破子陵滩下冰。\n欲识君家读书处，只问丹台指月僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天放庵","author":"智舷","text":"结茅野田外，犹自苦逢迎。\n遂拟径常塞，不容人暂行。\n日高僮仆睡，花落鸧鹒鸣。\n竹户忆曾启，饭僧炊午羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题履实上人新居","author":"智舷","text":"头陀冢间住，鬼食夜长分。\n密行许谁识，微言期自闻。\n树阴初上月，水气晚为云。\n别有示心处，不资半偈文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日奉怀真如大师","author":"智舷","text":"萧条无一事，日久坐茅斋。\n古树不知岁，落叶常满阶。\n凉风善多病，暮雨生秋怀。\n南寺有良晤，清言独伤乖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐污甫再过","author":"智舷","text":"越客重过岁五移，鹿田祠下久栖迟。\n至今贫贱身谁屈，如旧饥寒心自知。\n远涧竹泉秋后别，孤峰云径晓来思。\n所嗟咫尺稀相见，君若还山那可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋柳","author":"智舷","text":"怅望依依南浦南，春丝争吐似吴蚕。\n一枝一叶俱无恙，秋雨秋风也不堪。\n早识愁催青眼变，肯将颦与翠眉含。\n明年纵使连堤绿，能忍清霜满树酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谷响上人入匡庐石门涧","author":"智舷","text":"飘然汝去蹑何峰，六月匡庐雪尚封。\n芒履不妨江路草，净瓶将挂石门松。\n云开岭外逢僧影，日落岩前见虎踪。\n闻道远公莲再发，斋时还听虎溪钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居","author":"智舷","text":"独坐孤村日日风，土阶茅舍乱堆红。\n不知旧院深居地，凉叶幽花剩几丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新柳","author":"智舷","text":"谩说隋堤斗早春，还应妒杀楚宫人。\n一时看去青于眼，几处愁来翠欲颦。\n夜雨尚怜胜不得，东风只管舞教频。\n更堪亭外旋攀折，那有长条拂水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓月矶","author":"智舷","text":"石矶春晚白云闲，却倚东风一笑还。\n流水自深花自落，何人垂钓月明间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀高元雅","author":"智舷","text":"树飞黄叶豆开花，抚景萦思村路斜。\n秋竹百竿俱似玉，清池白月想君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上忆山居","author":"道敷","text":"忍置一茅舍，空闲丛竹傍。\n限归憎月闰，乞梦愿更长。\n草合深埋径，苔知自过墙。\n还怜挂瓢树，到日叶俱黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移住中州 其一","author":"道敷","text":"郭外故人屋，茅檐即水涯。\n远滩通鹭渚，近径借农家。\n移树惜阴薄，开篱当日斜。\n便知循乞处，村路不妨赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移住中州 其二","author":"道敷","text":"漫须论住后，只拟到来初。\n树冻花从里，烟寒柳任疏。\n饭因饥乌施，偈为老农书。\n尽慕居穷谷，深村可不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈汝纳姚叔祥晚过","author":"道敷","text":"迟令扃竹户，灯火未禅栖。\n遥见客投寺，犹疑渔出溪。\n别因日已久，语尽日应西。\n怪尔归偏促，行舟欲曙鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚同彭伯鹄访钱长卿","author":"道敷","text":"郊扉犹未掩，草径夕阴凝。\n汝出亦扶病，人寻恰共僧。\n竹多迟见月，风急屡防灯。\n欲更与深语，盘桓恐不胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题元朗水亭","author":"道敷","text":"微径树边入，亭偏池水涯。\n即能钟野趣，兼亦占鸥沙。\n晚色湖生月，秋香荇作花。\n竹扉分夜火，只与钓鱼艖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落红","author":"道敷","text":"开亦未几日，忽惊红乱飞。\n生憎风底急，犹赖燕衔归。\n随水意何限，过墙力渐微。\n虽含零落感，曾忆在芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日过就公赋","author":"道敷","text":"看竹闲相及，即非采艾期。\n感时心自摄，与坐语还痴。\n阶暝烟粘草，篱疏风损葵。\n乞来平日饭，都是午时炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结夏","author":"道敷","text":"未得向深谷，空林且暂依。\n自从草塞径，便不昼开扉。\n疏磬隔烟晚，凉云逗竹飞。\n相过平日客，谁复送令归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"借宿古招提","author":"道敷","text":"买舟浦南地，逆风迟到来。\n路行水次入，门借冢间开。\n林黑鬼啸树，阶青月上苔。\n未眠空外雁，犹自独飞哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为茅止生作悼亡诗 其一","author":"道敷","text":"忆汝立向晚，惊心月又明。\n忍从今独见，曾照昔同行。\n孤枕苦难即，空闺寒自生。\n含情应不寐，到晓只盈盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为茅止生作悼亡诗 其二","author":"道敷","text":"心惟结遐想，孤坐黯无言。\n误听滴花露，疑归清夜魂。\n也知伊岂在，终是我难谖。\n短袖残灯下，浑教污泪痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同钱叔达茅止生访蕴晖不值","author":"道敷","text":"信汝懒常出，空还所不虞。\n想应入深谷，悔少问樵夫。\n对竹坐堪久，虚檐日欲晡。\n无妨拟重过，岂畏路途迂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中怀黄叶老人","author":"大遂","text":"不断黄梅雨，知师反得闲。\n孤眠听鸣溜，孰谓非深山。\n苔色渐逾槛，溪光欲浸关。\n爨烟厌空寂，一去便忘还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林栖","author":"大遂","text":"当檐林静立，老屋破从遮。\n作梵邻听熟，翻经风搅差。\n地生无种药，瓶活不根花。\n偶与云同出，归吟任月斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠朱白民","author":"大遂","text":"山静犹空劫，惟将木石亲。\n肯居于此处，岂是等闲人。\n写竹卖供米，删松破作薪。\n只因寻异药，衣染别峰尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过村家","author":"大遂","text":"孤村临晚水，小屋背秋城。\n有径无人过，阴虫白昼鸣。\n谷欹苗叶曲，果拽树枝横。\n朴朴风淳古，庞眉笑出迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山道中","author":"大遂","text":"壁悬杖难容，盘旋青万重。\n到来深竹院，行尽数声钟。\n瀑挂雪边雪，云图峰外峰。\n此中皆静者，日暮不相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀圆印师兄","author":"大遂","text":"梅花开准合，梅子熟犹分。\n不住是真性，随栖如片云。\n只将诗拟见，岂有信相闻。\n想得悬瓢处，吟僧自一群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游顶山寺","author":"大遂","text":"山下顶山寺，凄凉丹雘无。\n不因逢老衲，将谓住樵夫。\n桥水石啮齿，门松藓剥肤。\n岩深霜信早，晚菊露黄须。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜怀见吾","author":"大遂","text":"立深苔履迹，夜已半秋声。\n当此影孤候，能禁思独生？\n灯骄萤火细，月借鹤衣明。\n若乃西方住，西方风露清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"大遂","text":"豪华已逐去江声，山色空含远代情。\n陈主《后庭花》不发，吴王前殿草长生。\n风高巷口秋烟冷，雨过城头晚照明。\n歌舞只今谁更似，鸟争啼巧柳轻盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门怀古","author":"大遂","text":"尚想黄池倚霸功，归来万乘一身空。\n越妃便泛五湖去，吴国长沦废沼中。\n台草诉人春黛绿，洲花怨水暮愁红。\n深情悭是盈亏月，不异当时照六宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳","author":"大遂","text":"沐雨梳烟千万枝，春风挽住定何时。\n青窥镜里愁人眼，翠染机中织女丝。\n柔舞难容莺坐稳，轻摇易惹燕飞迟。\n可怜岁岁章台路，肠断忘归游侠儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问路","author":"大遂","text":"兹路从谁又改迁，柳花深处问渔船。\n一言得过坏桥去，几步还停断岸边。\n笑自向来迷所转，就他耕者别求前。\n寻师果有安心法，何惜芒鞋费买钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋扇","author":"大遂","text":"莫以凉风多，弃捐敝箧里。\n试记无风时，是谁引风起？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯牙台","author":"大遂","text":"琴绝已多时，台存尚起思。\n遥怜千古调，只得一人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霁山行","author":"大遂","text":"山霁行尤喜，虽泥亦自前。\n不知吟思苦，忽到断桥边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]